---
title: "txpool_gas_limit_validation (EIP-7825: Transaction Gas Limit Cap)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: receive transaction tx
    q_receive --> q_check: gas_limit = tx.gasLimit
    q_check --> q_reject: gas_limit > 16777216
    q_check --> q_accept: gas_limit <= 16777216
    q_reject --> [*]: reject tx (MAX_GAS_LIMIT_EXCEEDED)
    q_accept --> [*]: add tx to txpool
    note right of q_accept
        INV-001: GAS_CAP = 16777216 (2^24) is a protocol constant
        INV-002: No transaction with gasLimit > GAS_CAP may enter the txpool
        INV-003: The gas cap is independent of the block gas limit
    end note
